<description>&lt;p&gt;China is threatening to cut undersea cables that link Taiwan and the Philippines while intensifying patrols near Taiwan, and a Chinese vessel carrying unidentified equipment was probed inside Scarborough Shoal by the Philippine Coast Guard. The Philippine Coast Guard rescued a ferry in Quezon waters, delivered fuel to fishermen at Scarborough Shoal, and assisted more than 150,000 sea travelers during the Undas period. China told the Philippines to stop politicians from crossing red lines, and Philippine officials criticised China’s inconsistent stance on UNCLOS and the South China Sea. 176 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQVTQzT3kxVmMtak9FMGI2bmhlVnFuUkpqUnZtWVE1SFRnaG93UVlOU3ZWQklTRDlqcTFJYTZOQXB1UnkxRHVOSDctN1ZJLTFxVElQeGtFaTRGcXJMZTQ1RGVIM2lXWWNxa3EzWTRNWS1FRWhjZ25BNUY3WnVmeFE3TEFLbi1OZzNQVEhOUFVPaDZ6ZlVaYV81NGVpUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE1Rc2Mtd1FPazlTVTgwbFZQYTFFZEc2QlMwRTVuaGFjNjAwWDEwYUlBSVhWS0ZPQmdQS2dEVW1kTVNvcU42VjBnNm02VS0tLWxFRGZrRkRNU3lFNG9CUzlmVjFEZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;NHKニュース&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxOeHBuZXRKMVZlSi1ldXVtVWp0ekI4Yi13Wk9xMjBOSC02OURfTExUSXJEbXFCOFU1emQ3UExjQ1FLLUdtUnM2YjVKc0RMQTFRTWxMbV9qR09zN1BIdmh0NElvVnBKaGl2NEFZRmNsc1M3OF9ueXdoejNQMXZud2NOSG9fTnN3c0psMmNCRkFDaXhRenF5ZmVHRi0xS2toWThRS0R5WC1LZjNzbkNiZEVLWHhCVk11X0dtM29wZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eurasia Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxOLW9PLVpRWTJtWmI4RTZfTktma1NnaG5HUnpCVXhpZzN6ZVdBOUc1cmdDZEl4VWlUbFQ0U2JvdC0zMjBoOXVFUDNzbGNvZlQ2WEhLNUFjZ1JXUkExeHF5Yko2VnhaclVrcHZsRlF3WVJiZWstdkhBbkpRZlRkemxJZGt3eU5nLVk?oc=5&quot;&gt;rpnradio.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=